    "texts": {
      "name": "Elgron",
      "biography": "Elgron is a warlock of the Dungeon who forged a pact with the ancient crimson dragons of the underworld. He deepened their bloodlust and taught them to feed on the life of their enemies, turning every Crimson Dragon into a living inferno. Under his command even the proud dragons of Dungeon and Rampart can be remade in crimson fire.",
      "specialty": {
        "description": "{Crimson Dragon}\r\n\r\nCrimson Dragons under Elgron gain +38% PERCENT_TO_ALL Life Drain (55% at base 40%) and +29% PERCENT_TO_ALL Fire Shield (45% at base 35%), plus +5 Shots. Ability bonuses scale with the creature's current values.\r\n\r\n{Red Dragon / Black Dragon / Green Dragon / Gold Dragon}\r\n\r\nCan upgrade Red and Black Dragons (Dungeon) and Green and Gold Dragons (Rampart) into Crimson Dragons.",
        "tooltip": "PERCENT_TO_ALL Life Drain and Fire Shield for Crimson Dragons; upgrades Red, Black, Green and Gold Dragons",
